/**
 * @brief Evaluate the printed Table 5 regressions for mineral loam and clay soils.
 * @param clay Mass percentage of particles smaller than 2 micrometers. (%)
 * @param organic_matter Soil organic-matter mass percentage. (%)
 * @return A result with the following fields:
 * - `bulk_density` — Dry bulk density predicted through the printed reciprocal-density
 * regression. (g/cm³)
 * - `theta_s` — Saturated volumetric water content predicted by the continuous regression.
 * (cm³/cm³)
 * - `saturated_conductivity` — Back-transformed saturated hydraulic conductivity. (cm/day)
 * - `alpha` — Back-transformed van Genuchten inverse pressure-head scale. (1/cm)
 * - `conductivity_shape_parameter` — Back-transformed Mualem hydraulic-conductivity shape
 * parameter. (dimensionless)
